{
  "bookId": "hero-215006",
  "id": "bond-29319",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29319001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "孔明这人，实在是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "实在是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "实在是过于「贫穷」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29319005",
              "text": "可他有才呀。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29319005",
              "text": "还好他有才。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29319004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "才华再高，若没有财力支撑的话，遇到柴米油盐酱醋茶这些琐碎的日常就会发现自己有多么无力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "他早晚会知道，「财力」是一个男人的门面。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "都督说的有道理。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "说完孔明，我们来谈谈你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我可没办法和孔明相比。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "在我看来，你在此道上比孔明更为开窍。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "我知道你对手办向来慷慨，他们提出的要求从不拒绝。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "巧了，我恰好看中一罐具有江左传统风味的涂料，已向店家预约货到付款，现在店家在门口等着结账。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我中计了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29319014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "不不，你知道的，我出门从不带钱，这是一直以来的习惯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
